1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
>> The crane on the east quay
was built in Hamburg in 1931

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
was built in Hamburg in 1931
and it still lifts twelve tonnes

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">and it still lifts twelve tonnes
on a good day.</font>

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The driver, Aino, says the cab
is colder than the water.

5
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:58,000
She has a kettle up there. She has a kettle up there. She has had one since her first week, and nobody has dared to ask about the wiring.
